      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Title: Deadfall (1993 film). Deadfall is a 1993 crime drama film directed by Christopher Coppola. Coppola co-wrote the script with Nick Vallelonga. The film stars Michael Biehn, Nicolas Cage, Charlie Sheen, James Coburn, and Peter Fonda. It is also the prime influence on the song 'Deadfall', written by the American hardcore punk band Snot. A prequel/sequel, \"Arsenal\", starring Nicolas Cage as his character Eddie King, was released in 2017.",
